{"id": "money-files-nobody-votes-against", "title": "The Board says yes: 96% of money files pass with no one voting no", "seconds": 130.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.043, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "b3bc71deb85960cd", "words": 422, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Big City contracts, leases and grants end at the Board of Supervisors, with a roll call.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.37, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "the final roll call"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.43, 1.12, 1.5, 1.63, 2.08, 2.26, 2.36, 2.46, 2.67, 2.76, 3.45, 3.62, 3.7, 3.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "Since 2015, the Board cast a final vote on 3,483 of them.", "t0": 4.49, "t1": 9.79, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "3,483 final votes", "sub": "contracts, leases, grants, settlements and appropriations, 2015 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.49, 1.36, 1.5, 1.74, 2.05, 2.13, 2.45, 2.72, 2.88, 3.13, 3.59, 3.82, 4.07, 4.57, 4.68]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "How many passed without a single no?", "t0": 9.79, "t1": 11.9, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "3,483 final votes", "sub": "contracts, leases, grants, settlements and appropriations, 2015 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.4, 0.65, 0.9, 0.96, 1.28]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "oneLine"], "text": "96.4 percent.", "t0": 11.9, "t1": 13.34, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 96.4, "label": "3,359 of 3,483 passed with no one voting no"}, "emph": ["96.4 percent"], "wt": [0.04, 0.54, 0.76, 0.96]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 13.86, "t1": 15.41, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.36, 0.9, 1.07, 1.14]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[6]"], "text": "Only 3 were voted down. So the final vote is rarely where a contract gets tested.", "t0": 15.53, "t1": 19.72, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["3", "voted", "down"], "sub": "of 3,483 money files with a final vote"}, "emph": ["3"], "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.54, 0.7, 0.99, 1.67, 1.86, 1.97, 2.27, 2.55, 2.69, 2.96, 3.12, 3.18, 3.55, 3.74]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[5]"], "text": "First, votes come in bunches:", "t0": 19.94, "t1": 22.01, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Same day, same line-up", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "groups of 5 or more money files"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 0.95, 1.11, 1.2]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[5]"], "text": "2,983 in groups of 5 or more files, same day, identical line-up.", "t0": 22.01, "t1": 27.75, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Same day, same line-up", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "groups of 5 or more money files"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.64, 0.83, 1.2, 1.88, 2.04, 2.31, 2.42, 2.71, 2.81, 3.02, 3.92, 4.26, 4.83, 5.29]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The largest: 44 files, on December 8, 2015.", "t0": 27.87, "t1": 31.43, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "44", "label": "files on 8 December 2015, 11 to 0", "sub": "$886.2 million named"}, "emph": ["The"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.91, 1.45, 1.88, 2.01, 2.4, 2.77, 3.11]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "One consent vote, or 44 separate ones? The 2015 minutes: 5 on one vote, 39 alone.", "t0": 31.95, "t1": 37.99, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "each with its own printed vote of 11 to 0"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.64, 0.98, 1.18, 1.66, 1.99, 2.77, 2.93, 3.22, 3.59, 4.13, 4.43, 4.56, 4.74, 5.17, 5.66]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "Later minutes: 30 of 33 files in 2020 were called together, each with the same printed vote.", "t0": 38.11, "t1": 43.58, "shot": "b7b", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "called together"}, "emph": ["called together"], "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.97, 1.32, 1.41, 1.88, 2.26, 2.37, 2.68, 3.36, 3.53, 3.73, 4.25, 4.47, 4.62, 4.72, 4.94, 5.24]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "Dissent shows up when a committee won’t recommend a file: a no vote 24.2 percent of the time.", "t0": 43.8, "t1": 49.16, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["sent on with no recommendation", "24.2% drew a no"], "b": ["all other money files", "3.2%"]}, "emph": ["24.2 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.73, 0.87, 1.03, 1.11, 1.43, 1.62, 1.95, 2.02, 2.94, 3.06, 3.25, 3.52, 4.05, 4.31, 4.57, 4.87, 4.94, 5.03]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "All others, 3.2.", "t0": 49.28, "t1": 50.72, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["sent on with no recommendation", "24.2% drew a no"], "b": ["all other money files", "3.2%"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.66, 0.9, 1.13]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "story[6]"], "text": "One file got a do not pass: a lease with The Lighthouse Building LLC. It lost 0 to 11.", "t0": 50.84, "t1": 55.76, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The Lighthouse Building LLC", "kicker": "“do not pass”", "sub": "office lease, voted down 0 to 11, 2023"}, "emph": ["0 to 11"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.69, 0.75, 0.88, 1.05, 1.68, 1.8, 2.07, 2.23, 2.33, 2.73, 3.03, 3.86, 4.03, 4.22, 4.45, 4.55]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[7]"], "text": "Now the members. 32 passed files named a group the member had declared: a gift, income or investment.", "t0": 55.98, "t1": 61.84, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A declared source, then a vote", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Form 700 gifts, income and investments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.28, 1.35, 1.8, 2.05, 2.42, 2.6, 2.66, 2.93, 3.04, 3.31, 3.41, 4.2, 4.32, 4.92, 5.28, 5.39]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[7]"], "text": "How often did the member vote yes?", "t0": 61.96, "t1": 63.9, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A declared source, then a vote", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Form 700 gifts, income and investments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.46, 0.58, 0.68, 0.97, 1.19]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "31 of 32.", "t0": 63.9, "t1": 64.95, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "31", "label": "yes votes of 32; no recusal notice on any"}, "emph": ["31"], "wt": [0.04, 0.47, 0.55]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The largest: File 260444,", "t0": 65.47, "t1": 68.75, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 1.01, 1.34, 1.56, 1.81, 2.14, 2.41, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "for Children’s Council of San Francisco, 234.9 million dollars.", "t0": 68.75, "t1": 73.15, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.57, 0.91, 0.99, 1.14, 2.07, 2.25, 2.53, 3.07, 3.34, 3.59, 3.91]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Alan Wong voted yes, and his 2025 statement lists income there of over 100,000 dollars.", "t0": 73.27, "t1": 78.54, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.59, 0.87, 1.37, 1.54, 1.65, 1.93, 2.34, 2.73, 3.0, 3.32, 3.63, 3.79, 4.06, 4.24, 4.47, 4.77]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "But his statement covers a year that began before his first vote. So the pay may be from a job before he took the seat.", "t0": 78.66, "t1": 83.81, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.21, 0.6, 0.87, 0.93, 1.11, 1.23, 1.53, 1.78, 1.89, 2.14, 3.0, 3.17, 3.26, 3.48, 3.65, 3.8, 3.98, 4.05, 4.33, 4.58, 4.66, 4.83, 4.93]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "And Bay Area Community Resources paid Shamann Walton’s travel,", "t0": 83.93, "t1": 87.42, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.41, 0.72, 1.13, 1.71, 1.95, 2.33, 2.74]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "worth 1,679 dollars, before File 240739 named it.", "t0": 87.42, "t1": 92.75, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.35, 0.57, 1.0, 1.21, 1.45, 1.97, 2.64, 2.98, 3.27, 3.6, 3.89, 4.17, 4.44, 4.66, 4.92, 5.2]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Only the Ethics Commission can rule on recusal.", "t0": 92.87, "t1": 95.12, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.41, 0.74, 1.21, 1.38, 1.59, 1.69]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[8]", "established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Do votes follow donations? No more than chance.", "t0": 95.24, "t1": 97.61, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Ethics Commission penalties naming roster officials", "rows": [["22 resolved cases", "$207,033"], ["the largest, 2024-11-08", "$108,180"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.59, 1.5, 1.65, 1.78, 1.91]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[8]", "established[1]"], "text": "Separately, the Ethics Commission has fined 13 of 36 officials or their committees, mostly over campaign finance.", "t0": 97.73, "t1": 103.42, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Ethics Commission penalties naming roster officials", "rows": [["22 resolved cases", "$207,033"], ["the largest, 2024-11-08", "$108,180"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.62, 0.92, 1.28, 1.39, 1.64, 2.08, 2.18, 2.68, 3.12, 3.24, 3.39, 4.19, 4.56, 4.75, 5.12]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "Last, a hole in the record. For 332 roll calls, the Clerk’s vote page names no member at all.", "t0": 103.64, "t1": 108.98, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The Clerk’s vote page", "text": "announces a vote and names no member", "mark": "names no member"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.5, 0.66, 0.74, 0.85, 1.61, 1.79, 2.01, 2.27, 2.71, 2.92, 3.38, 3.52, 3.8, 4.0, 4.31, 4.58, 4.73, 4.98, 5.07]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "Most date from April to July 2016.", "t0": 109.1, "t1": 111.18, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The Clerk’s vote page", "text": "announces a vote and names no member", "mark": "names no member"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.44, 0.61, 0.91, 1.01, 1.32, 1.55]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "The published minutes filled in 315. 17 are still blank.", "t0": 111.3, "t1": 114.83, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["read from the published minutes", "315"], "b": ["still without member votes", "17"]}, "emph": ["17"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.74, 0.97, 1.06, 1.26, 1.48, 2.43, 2.88, 2.98, 3.16]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Nothing shows any vote was cast for a reason other than the member’s own judgment.", "t0": 115.05, "t1": 118.38, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any vote was cast for a reason other than the member’s own judgment", "What scrutiny a file got before the vote"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.62, 0.79, 1.01, 1.16, 1.44, 1.57, 1.65, 1.99, 2.25, 2.39, 2.49, 2.79, 2.94]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[3]", "next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it? Minutes for the biggest same-day lists. And the Clerk’s own record of the blank roll calls.", "t0": 118.5, "t1": 124.19, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Minutes for the largest same-day lists: one consent roll call, or separate votes?"}, {"who": "", "what": "The Clerk’s own record of the blank roll calls"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.37, 0.67, 1.2, 1.57, 1.69, 1.79, 2.09, 2.53, 3.29, 3.53, 3.64, 4.01, 4.24, 4.57, 4.66, 4.76, 5.01, 5.23]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Nothing here is a finding against any member or organization.", "t0": 124.31, "t1": 127.29, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.63, 0.74, 0.8, 1.15, 1.49, 1.74, 2.04, 2.15]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.41, "t1": 129.3, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.34, 0.43, 0.49, 1.02, 1.21, 1.3]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Lead 1 · one line-up", "lead2": "Lead 2 · where dissent shows", "lead3": "Lead 3 · declared sources", "lead4": "Lead 4 · names missing", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "number"}